⚡️🇺🇸 President Palm Beach Trump has launched Truth API, a new subscription service offering businesses and trading firms early, real-time access to posts on Truth Social for fees of up to $100,000 per month.

The move has drawn criticism from Democratic lawmakers and other reps, who argue it could allow paying subscribers to act on market-moving presidential posts before the wider public. They have called for a regulatory investigation into potential conflicts of interest.

